<section class="orbitra-story" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="orbitra-container">
    <div class="orbitra-story__feature orbitra-glass" data-reveal>
      <div class="orbitra-story__copy">
        <p class="orbitra-eyebrow">SEE IT IN ACTION</p>
        <h2 class="orbitra-section-title">Throw it. Guide it.<span>Watch it come back.</span></h2>
        <p class="orbitra-subtitle orbitra-story__text">Orbitra turns a simple toss into glowing, hands-on flight. Change the angle of your throw to send it forward, curve it through the air, or guide it back toward you.</p>
        <div class="orbitra-story__motion" aria-label="Throw, fly, catch, repeat">
          <span>THROW</span><i></i><span>FLY</span><i></i><span>CATCH</span><i></i><span>REPEAT</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="orbitra-video-shell orbitra-story__video-shell">
        <div class="orbitra-video-frame" data-orbitra-video-frame>
          <video class="orbitra-action-video" data-orbitra-story-video muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="{{ 'orb-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" aria-label="Orbitra flying orb in action">
            <source data-src="{{ 'orbita-custom-video-1.mp4' | asset_url }}" type="video/mp4">
            Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
          </video>
          <button type="button" class="orbitra-video-sound" data-orbitra-sound-toggle aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Turn video sound on">
            <span class="orbitra-video-sound__icon" aria-hidden="true">♪</span>
            <span data-orbitra-sound-label>Sound on</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="orbitra-steps">
      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal><span class="orbitra-step__number">01</span><h3>Power it on.</h3><p>Switch on Orbitra, hold the center axis, and spin the wheel to start the rotor.</p></article>
      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><span class="orbitra-step__number">02</span><h3>Give it a toss.</h3><p>Use a controlled throw and change the angle to explore different flight paths.</p></article>
      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><span class="orbitra-step__number">03</span><h3>Guide the flight.</h3><p>Experiment with direction, distance, and timing while the LEDs light up the motion.</p></article>
      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><span class="orbitra-step__number">04</span><h3>Catch. Repeat.</h3><p>Catch Orbitra, reset your throw, and try a new route, trick, or return path.</p></article>
    </div>

    <div class="orbitra-spec-strip orbitra-glass" data-reveal>
      <div><strong>6–8 MIN</strong><span>Typical flight time</span></div>
      <div><strong>30–35 MIN</strong><span>Charging time</span></div>
      <div><strong>9.5 × 9.5 CM</strong><span>Compact size</span></div>
      <div><strong>USB</strong><span>Rechargeable</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{"name":"Orbitra Story","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Orbitra Story"}]}
{% endschema %}
